# fixedbugs, defect 143, panel 185 R1, lane ffi-macro, 2026-10-02.
#
# `SQUAR` is no macro and no function of the header: the question unit's
# `#ifdef SQUAR` answers nothing, so the message stays `ffi_unknown_name`'s,
# the header declares no such name, which is true.

extern "fixedbugs-143-macros.h"
    function SQUAR(x: i32) -> i32  #~ ffi_unknown_name

function main()
    print(SQUAR(x: 3))
